WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:06.490
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and this week
on Teen Wolf did anyone else get a Back to

00:00:06.490 --> 00:00:11.050
the Future Vibe? No really, it got crazy but
a few big things were confirmed. They also

00:00:11.050 --> 00:00:14.700
decided to air the episode ahead of the VMAs
because they thought everyone would be sleeping

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:15.900
through Monday?

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:21.630
I feel like all the people who watched the
VMAs were already Teen Wolf fans, so it seems

00:00:21.630 --> 00:00:22.789
a little ridiculous. Especially since they
already were confirmed for an expanded fifth

00:00:22.789 --> 00:00:26.529
season. But whatever. Let’s talk about the
true alpha. Careful for spoilers from the

00:00:26.529 --> 00:00:30.189
episode if you haven’t seen it yet. Here
are my top 5 wtf moments. I’ll wait just

00:00:30.189 --> 00:00:33.070
a sec...Okay, here we go.

00:00:33.070 --> 00:00:34.589
Number 5 - Brett is Back

00:00:34.589 --> 00:00:39.339
It was a nice callback to the events of episode
5. Remember, Brett is from Liam’s old school.

00:00:39.339 --> 00:00:42.549
And even though Scott kinda saved his life
he still seems like he’s got a giant chip

00:00:42.549 --> 00:00:46.710
on his shoulder. I’m still a little confused
about the Liam rage situation, but I’m assuming

00:00:46.710 --> 00:00:51.239
that those two have buried the hatchet...in
someone’s face. Because now the deadpool

00:00:51.239 --> 00:00:55.869
is at the level where assault teams packing
hunter gear are after them.

00:00:55.869 --> 00:00:59.019
It also seemed like Brett and the girl, who
may or may not have been his little sister,

00:00:59.019 --> 00:01:02.830
were part of Satomi’s pack. Or they might
become part of a new pack, because I think

00:01:02.830 --> 00:01:06.100
all of Satomi’s old pack were killed by
the virus.

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:11.730
Brett was kind of like the stand in for rage
face Liam. Whenever you have a crazy episode,

00:01:11.730 --> 00:01:16.410
tv rules dictate one of your friends has to
lose their shit. Like Reservoir Dogs, one

00:01:16.410 --> 00:01:19.220
of the guys always has to go crazy.

00:01:19.220 --> 00:01:23.600
Speaking of which, Number 4 - Liam is still
losing his mind

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:28.620
It’s really sweet to see Scott step up as
a big brother when Liam goes into puppy mode.

00:01:28.620 --> 00:01:33.950
Like he wants to crawl under his bed and hide.
I was happy that Scott referenced all their

00:01:33.950 --> 00:01:36.680
dead friends. Not everyone gets a happy ending.

00:01:36.680 --> 00:01:41.090
I think Liam’s story was all about setting
up a big hero moment in the last two episodes.

00:01:41.090 --> 00:01:44.390
He’ll figure out how he fits in Scott’s
world and start to think of the pack as his

00:01:44.390 --> 00:01:48.810
There is no part of me that feels like any
of the good looking people this season will

00:01:48.810 --> 00:01:52.080
die. Tyler Hoechlin, Liam, Kira, even Brett.
They’ll all be back for season 5.

00:01:52.080 --> 00:01:55.010
The real person I think is on the hit list
is Satomi.

00:01:55.010 --> 00:01:59.890
Which leads me to Number 3 - Satomi is an
alpha without a pack and three things that

00:01:59.890 --> 00:02:00.960
won’t stay hidden.

00:02:00.960 --> 00:02:04.820
I feel like her three things are foreshadowing
that she’s going to sacrifice herself to

00:02:04.820 --> 00:02:08.080
save Scott.
Who else here feels like of all the epic things

00:02:08.080 --> 00:02:12.010
that could happen in the finale. Peter will
get his Alpha powers back and be more of a

00:02:12.010 --> 00:02:13.800
black hat wearing villain in season 5.

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:15.950
In order to get his Alpha powers back, Peter
needs to kill an alpha. Which he says is Scott.

00:02:15.950 --> 00:02:19.870
But there are two alphas on the show right
now. And of those two, which one do you think

00:02:19.870 --> 00:02:22.170
the show is going to keep.

00:02:22.170 --> 00:02:27.850
I didn’t really see it clearly until Satomi
explained the sun, the moon and the truth

00:02:27.850 --> 00:02:32.959
to Chris Argent. Instead of being this really
zen mantra. It sounded like Satomi truly believes

00:02:32.959 --> 00:02:36.849
that her wolf nature will ultimately consume
her and she’ll start ripping everyone up

00:02:36.849 --> 00:02:39.910
like during the flashback to Oak Creek.

00:02:39.910 --> 00:02:46.910
There are a couple of big arcs people get
in genre stories like Teen Wolf. Hero arcs,

00:02:47.270 --> 00:02:52.810
where people like Liam accept the call to
action to become a hero, villain arcs, where

00:02:52.810 --> 00:02:57.780
people like Peter show their true nature and
tragic arcs, where good people are destined

00:02:57.780 --> 00:03:02.300
to die. Like I think Satomi is.

00:03:02.300 --> 00:03:06.250
Derek is a different story. I feel like his
tragic arc is a false positive this season.

00:03:06.250 --> 00:03:09.840
He won’t end up dying and he’ll turn the
situation around and either get his powers

00:03:09.840 --> 00:03:12.810
back or find a way to contribute without them.

00:03:12.810 --> 00:03:16.870
on to Benefactor craziness, my number 2 moment
is Meredith and Peter.

00:03:16.870 --> 00:03:21.500
Based on the way they presented it, Peter
is lying about Inceptioning Meredith to enact

00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:25.200
the Deadpool List. Meredith always wants to
help.

00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:30.470
I’m still trying to decide if I like this
explanation better or if I liked it better

00:03:30.470 --> 00:03:34.129
when I thought Meredith was faking her disability
and was behind it all. I’m definitely happy

00:03:34.129 --> 00:03:35.800
that this isn’t all some simple Meredith
Revenge plot.

00:03:35.800 --> 00:03:42.760
I think Peter is only half lying, yes he did
use his alpha powers to ghost whisper Meredith

00:03:42.760 --> 00:03:47.900
in the hospital. I think that was intentional.
Remember, his mind was completely intact.

00:03:47.900 --> 00:03:54.900
He was just comatose. Like a highly lucid
dream he was able to control.

00:04:00.200 --> 00:04:05.420
Meredith had just been taken to the hospital
so she was in a state of shock and open to

00:04:05.420 --> 00:04:08.720
psychic attack. Wanting to help she listened
to everything peter said as if he were dictating

00:04:08.720 --> 00:04:08.940
instructions.

00:04:08.940 --> 00:04:12.680
The only part I think Peter wasn’t lying
about was going crazy. Under normal conditions

00:04:12.680 --> 00:04:16.569
he’s lawful neutral. But after the fire
while he was trapped inside his own mind he

00:04:16.569 --> 00:04:22.289
went chaotic evil. He had a dark fantasy that
he may or may not have undertaken, but the

00:04:22.289 --> 00:04:25.360
fire and the coma pushed him over the edge.

00:04:25.360 --> 00:04:29.379
So yes he’s responsible for everything but
had he not been almost burned to death, he

00:04:29.379 --> 00:04:33.650
probably would have come up with a less crazy
plan that didn’t involve killing so many

00:04:33.650 --> 00:04:35.050
people.

00:04:35.050 --> 00:04:41.960
I think he’ll always be the villain of the
series, but part of what makes him interesting

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:48.960
is that he’s a neutral figure. He can jump
back and forth between good and evil. He’s

00:04:49.680 --> 00:04:53.550
the Tom Hiddleston Loki of the series. Except
he doesn’t enjoy chaos quite as much.

00:04:53.550 --> 00:04:56.589
He’s a villain of opportunity. So he’ll
continue to help Scott’s pack when it suits

00:04:56.589 --> 00:04:56.789
him.

00:04:56.789 --> 00:05:00.150
and finally my number 1 wtf moment - Peter
and Kate are going to Kill Scott

00:05:00.150 --> 00:05:07.150
I should say try to kill. That’s not it,
did anyone else wonder if Peter somehow secretly

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:13.129
orchestrated the fire that killed his family
too?

00:05:13.129 --> 00:05:19.659
I think it would be an amazing stroke of villainy
if he did. He’s definitely playing Kate

00:05:19.659 --> 00:05:23.619
just like everyone else. But them working
together seemed like it only just started

00:05:23.619 --> 00:05:29.129
this season. Their Kill Scott moment gave
me the vibe that they’d been working together

00:05:29.129 --> 00:05:30.680
a lot longer though.

00:05:30.680 --> 00:05:37.680
It was the fact Peter didn’t explain Meredith
to Kate, like she already knew.

00:05:39.360 --> 00:05:43.520
Peter ranting about how Talia was sinking
the ship got me thinking. He wanted to take

00:05:43.520 --> 00:05:48.309
control of the pack but needed to get rid
of her. So he contacts Kate to seduce Derek

00:05:48.309 --> 00:05:51.460
as a teenager and then convinces Kate to set
the fire.

00:05:51.460 --> 00:05:56.860
If it’s true they were always working together
I definitely think the fire was his idea,

00:05:56.860 --> 00:06:03.689
not Kate’s. It would make her a lot more
sympathetic and Peter would be a much grander

00:06:03.689 --> 00:06:04.360
villain.

00:06:04.360 --> 00:06:07.599
Like I said though, I don’t think they’ll
be able to kill Scott, but Peter will probably

00:06:07.599 --> 00:06:12.199
still get his power back by killing Satomi.
There are a number of other ways it can go

00:06:12.199 --> 00:06:19.199
down. But in order to make Peter a viable
threat in season 5, he has to power up somehow.

00:06:19.689 --> 00:06:23.629
But let me know what you’re favorite moment
was and do you think Peter will get his alpha

00:06:23.629 --> 00:06:24.849
power back?

00:06:24.849 --> 00:06:28.830
I know I didn’t mention it but the Yellow
Flower, does anyone else feel like this like

00:06:28.830 --> 00:06:33.889
super wolfsbane or something. Like a wolfsbane
A-Bomb. A measure of last resort. It was being

00:06:33.889 --> 00:06:37.680
grown in the Argent’s warehouse, so it has
to be a weapon of some kind. And the only

00:06:37.680 --> 00:06:41.050
plant based weapon on the show right now is
Wolfsbane.

00:06:41.050 --> 00:06:46.379
Normal Wolfsbane is purple though. Why is
the plant yellow? Lots of good things to follow

00:06:46.379 --> 00:06:52.659
up on in the last two episodes.

00:06:52.659 --> 00:06:55.999
Overall I gave the episode a solid B plus.
I loved the interrogation scene with Peter

00:06:55.999 --> 00:07:02.919
and Meredith. That felt like the whole episode
and everything else was B-story. I like the

00:07:02.919 --> 00:07:08.659
setups for all the bigger characters, Liam
will get his chance to be a hero. Derek is

00:07:08.659 --> 00:07:15.659
learning to contribute without powers, Kate
and Peter reveal their game ending plan.

00:07:22.509 --> 00:07:27.139
I’ve been really happy with the way they
got rid of the crazy supernatural aspects

00:07:27.139 --> 00:07:29.580
from season 3B. I totally get why making the
story about much more human problems makes

00:07:29.580 --> 00:07:32.210
all the characters easier to connect with.

00:07:32.210 --> 00:07:37.649
And making Peter the one true villain again
is always going to be the most fun configuration.

00:07:37.649 --> 00:07:41.629
As much of a bummer as it is to see Derek
lose the thing that made him special I think

00:07:41.629 --> 00:07:48.360
it’s a smart move if he’s going to stay
on the show. Scott will always be the Alpha

00:07:48.360 --> 00:07:49.939
despite what Peter says.

00:07:49.939 --> 00:07:54.300
So it really narrowed a lot of places you
could take Derek’s character. Now in season

00:07:54.300 --> 00:08:01.300
5, he has this whole new Derek he learn how
to be. It will be like a reverse Liam. Liam

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:06.919
learns to fit in with his new powers, Derek
learns how to fit in without his powers.

00:08:06.919 --> 00:08:13.369
Like I said, Teen Wolf Buddy Cop Spinoff.
I just feel like that would be a cool show

00:08:13.369 --> 00:08:15.869
for Derek, Chris Argent and Braeden. I didn’t
include Parrish, because you can’t have

00:08:15.869 --> 00:08:19.610
parrish without Lydia and Lydia will always
stay with the pack.

00:08:19.610 --> 00:08:22.319
Final thoughts are that I’ve very excited
about the last two episodes. It’s been a

00:08:22.319 --> 00:08:25.969
great season, way better than 3B.

00:08:25.969 --> 00:08:32.969
So in case you don’t follow me on twitter
or facebook, I’ve been moving this week.

00:08:33.870 --> 00:08:37.440
I’ll do a room tour video when I’m done,
but I’ve got a bunch more videos to finish

00:08:37.440 --> 00:08:38.140
and I’m way behind.

00:08:38.140 --> 00:08:41.270
My next Teen wolf video will be next week.
Be sure to subscribe to get it if you’re

00:08:41.270 --> 00:08:45.650
new to my channel. Later tonight I should
have a new Marvel video up. Donald Glover

00:08:45.650 --> 00:08:51.960
is going to play spiderman in a cartoon. So
I’ll explain what’s going on with that.

